# Twinstone Bonding (windurst 62), completion parity: 490's finish while accepted is npcUtil.completeQuest step for step
# (the Wrapped Bow, stopping when it cannot be given; fame 16 Windurst; the title), ending in the raw
# player:completeQuest, so a GM's Quest[2][62]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup, which a called
# Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) with GiohAijhriSpokenTo 1 beside Gioh Ajihri.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=106.2,-4.75,173.9 job=WAR lvl=75
item TwinstoneEarring
charvar GiohAijhriSpokenTo 1
login
quest Windurst.TwinstoneBonding accepted
charvar Quest[2][62]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Gioh_Ajihri                     # accepted: 488 (beside him)
finish                                  # var 1
trade Gioh_Ajihri TwinstoneEarring x1   # 490
finish                                  # the earring taken; needToZone; var 0; the bow; fame 16; the title; Prog kept
